              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.21+NUM.21.22+NUM.21.23+NUM.21.24+NUM.21.25+NUM.21.26+NUM.21.27+NUM.21.28+NUM.21.29+NUM.21.30+NUM.21.31+NUM.21.32+NUM.21.33+NUM.21.34+NUM.21.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 21:21-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Poi 2:26-3:11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie maeni gi ju m’ubimo mi ng’ombe, ma nyithindho mir Israel gigoyo, man gimwonyo ng’om migi loka Yordan yo ku wokceng’, ugambre kum poga mir Arnon cil kum got Hermon, man ng’om Araba pet yo nyangu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sihon m’ubimo mi Juamori, m’ubedo i Hecbon, man ebimo ugambre Aroer, ma en e dhu poga mir Arnon, man adhura m’ubedo i kind pogane, ku ng’et Gilead, cil kum kulo Yabok, ma kieu mi nyithindho mir Amon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ng’om mir Araba cil kum nam Cineroth, yo nyangu, man kum nam mir Araba, en e Nam Kadu, yo nyangu, yo ba Beth-yecimoth; man yor ariwa ma piny, the ka m’alora mi Pisga: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man kieu pa Og m’ubimo mi Bacan, mi dong’ Jurefaim, m’ubedo Actaroth man i Edrei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ebimo i got Hermon, man i Saleka, man i Bacan ceke, cil kum kieu mi Jugecuri ku Jumakathi, man ng’et Gilead, kieu pa Sihon m’ubimo mi Hecbon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 32:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ma jatic pa Yehova man nyithindho mir Israel gigoyogi: man Musa ma jatic pa Yehova emie ni Jurubeni, ku Jugadi, man ng’et suru pa Manase ni aba migi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
